            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What’s new in Lunchbox 1.4.2</h2>
<p>Messages and other iPad-style apps (Find My, Home, Stocks, Weather) open straight to their tile's full size. Sort My Windows is now first in the menu. And Lunchbox's source is now on GitHub: build it yourself for free, or buy the signed copy that updates itself.</p>
]]></description>
