        <item>
            <title>1.4.1</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 17:14:01 -0600</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>248</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What’s new in Lunchbox 1.4.1</h2>
<p>No more empty tiles: when an app quits or closes a window without saying so, its tile goes right away, and the windows around a closed one fill its gap at once. ⌘⇧ and the arrows stack windows again when there's a column too many, and move a window alone in its column above or below the one beside it. New windows never open in a sliver beside a narrow column.</p>
]]></description>
